{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>NexaKids 是一款把早期學習與創意培養結合的應用，以色彩豐富的介面陪伴學前兒童認識字母、數字與日常詞彙，並透過描寫與繪畫留下想像空間。程式內建 141 張學習卡，適閤家長與小朋友在家中或外出時一同探索。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-107.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>八類學習卡配合語音導讀</h2>\n<p>八個學習範疇包括字母、數字、水果、動物、顏色、形狀、單詞與書寫，數字涵蓋 0 至 20，字母收錄全部 26 個。學習卡支援語音播放，小朋友可邊看邊聽；引導式描寫練習有助掌握字母與數字筆順，自由繪畫則可自行配搭顏色。進度記錄保存在裝置上，並可切換淺色或深色主題。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-348-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-349-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-350-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-351-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-352-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-353-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：NexaKids</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/nexakids/id6813227995?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T13:02:01.576094+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":313,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T12:51:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T19:18:20.275873+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T12:58:37.979292+00:00","content_hash":"26e86d9393718bd5fc04ac1aa3f13692c525e71dc74ffc008bbe026721e26dbb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}